{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0249_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0249_story_01_title", "source_sha256": "8bdeb8c631b876072e7450061aa2a2ea2bf8772a189759b3b878050b99b2ef41", "ja": "開幕！　グルメバトル", "zh": "开幕！美食对决", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0249_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0249_story_01_synopsis", "source_sha256": "828cf2b7589e958a1639bd27b5cb5707892745a2a5d00363f072d49d54487ca9", "ja": "全国ツアーチーム『SHADE OF SPADE』\nと、ご当地ローカルTV番組とのタイアップ\nが実現！　紬、響、風花、茜は2チームに分\nかれ、それぞれお店のアンバサダーとして、\nグルメバトルをする事に。意気込む一同！", "zh": "全国巡演团队『SHADE OF SPADE』与当地电视节目达成合作！　紬、响、风花、茜分成2个团队，分别作为店铺大使进行美食对决。大家都干劲十足！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0249_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0249_story_01_1000_p", "source_sha256": "a3b809fd8f962e60d4decf738e7eb3dabea3bb168abb9b87e0b3483eb50d41b4", "ja": "（ローカル局とのタイアップのため、\nツアー中メンバーの何人かに時間を取ってもらった！）", "zh": "（为了与地方电视台联动，抽出了巡演期间几位成员的时间！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0249_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0249_story_01_1001_023aka", "source_sha256": "096d0748e1623981cbeaf9e48ff1fcbac979c459a6c302a566f33c4112c51d71", "ja": "ふっ、さすがだよ、{$P$}ちゃん……\n茜ちゃんを選ぶとは、わかってるね☆", "zh": "哼，不愧是你啊，{$P$}……\n居然选了小茜，真懂行啊☆", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0249_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0249_story_01_1002_023aka", "source_sha256": "7cb0872e7ba7f2bda97e247ef9e6fe40f5e8f5600bc226f636a6435f39cd6e15", "ja": "テレビは大ウケ、そしてツアーも大成功……\n見えたよ！　約束された勝利への道筋が！", "zh": "电视节目大受欢迎，巡演也大获成功……\n我看到了！通往注定胜利的道路！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0249_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0249_story_01_1003_051tmg", "source_sha256": "ccf8500d5ebc22c6e7fc285eb62d703027ba88794b24681c134f389f1f2eb518", "ja": "番組のメインテーマまで任せていただけるとは……。\n大きな仕事になりそうですね。", "zh": "连节目主旋律都交给我们负责……真是没想到。\n看来会是一项重要的工作呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0249_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0249_story_01_1004_041fuk", "source_sha256": "ed53ed6b6f5d8b0208ff54366cb9d83bc88139761cfceacb8f0999a0ded50a23", "ja": "そうよね。上手にこなせたら、ツアーのすごくいい\n宣伝になりそうだし。頑張らなきゃ……！", "zh": "是啊。要是能顺利完成的话，应该能成为巡演非常好的宣传机会。所以得加油才行……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0249_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0249_story_01_1005_013hib", "source_sha256": "5e64517ae6373553c18a56d9f5c5b78364f0526b5975ef51a725965133a9f334", "ja": "うんうん！　それにローカル局の仕事って、\n新規のファンに見てもらえるチャンスだしね。", "zh": "嗯嗯！而且地方电视台的工作，也是让新粉丝看到我们的机会嘛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0249_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0249_story_01_1006_p", "source_sha256": "8e9e6570c46b2d8798c9114244a4bb89ee56c4b975e90a6b6ec814094bfeb534", "ja": "そうだな、色々なメリットのある仕事だと思うよ。\n是非みんなで成功させてくれ！", "zh": "没错，我觉得这是一份有很多好处的工作。务必要和大家一起把它做成功！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0249_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0249_story_01_1007_051tmg", "source_sha256": "235693b7ac870b85472758ffcc43797dc17566fccd95667710cab432ed09d773", "ja": "あの……ところで{$P$}。\n肝心の番組の内容を、教えてもらっていませんが……。", "zh": "那个……话说回来，{$P$}先生。节目的具体内容，你还没告诉我们……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0249_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0249_story_01_1008_051tmg", "source_sha256": "3e79ae257490b51af90890dde88e85f09fecb34345566b5ad865d7d0b17e0fb5", "ja": "はっ。ここまでもったいつけるという事は、\nまさか……私達に、えげつないドッキリを……？", "zh": "啊。都卖关子卖到现在了，难道……是要对我们搞什么过分的恶作剧……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0249_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0249_story_01_1009_p", "source_sha256": "84454cf65d279a0f8c83c6981362b2d5d2c92df61c187638b22f6bb91f171aef", "ja": "ち、違う違う！　今から説明するところで、ええと……\n資料によると、グルメバトルだな。", "zh": "不、不是不是！我正要说明来着，那个……\n根据资料，是美食对决。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0249_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0249_story_01_1010_041fuk", "source_sha256": "d04f2b6f322e9d94f7b741c61ed664f5da788b7669c73b941548a8ee90961390", "ja": "グルメバトル？\nそれって、料理で対決ってことですか？", "zh": "美食对决？\n也就是说，要用料理一决胜负吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0249_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0249_story_01_1011_p", "source_sha256": "8e3a68b634ad7d510366e9f84b2bd31ee7cabf7a6793a358a354aff41927698b", "ja": "うん。高級フレンチからB級グルメまで、\n地元の色々なお店が、1対1で対決する番組だそうだ。", "zh": "嗯。据说是个由当地各类店铺进行1对1对决的节目，\n从高档法餐到平民小吃应有尽有。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0249_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0249_story_01_1012_p", "source_sha256": "5b1f6136013abedf765811c4147203ecfb57dc02bdcda8bed3fc33548fed8689", "ja": "みんなはアンバサダーとして、それぞれ担当の\nお店を勝たせるために頑張る……ということらしい！", "zh": "大家将作为大使，为了让自己负责的\n店铺获胜而努力……好像是这么回事！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0249_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0249_story_01_1013_023aka", "source_sha256": "acadc8e48b17106584ba51aaba3b70553756bd9283602f802fe474c9176b4a70", "ja": "アンバサダー！？　ますます茜ちゃん向きの仕事\nじゃん！　いいの？　茜ちゃん圧勝しちゃうけど！", "zh": "大使！？这工作越来越适合小茜了！真的可以吗？我可是会让小茜大获全胜的哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0249_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0249_story_01_1014_013hib", "source_sha256": "6490b9812194c1a088fe74c86bcca346401488b275b0c0b87deefdfe40750320", "ja": "あははっ。茜、すごい自信だね。\nでもバトルってことなら、自分も負けないぞ！", "zh": "啊哈哈。茜，真有自信呢。\n不过既然是对决，自己也不会输的哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0249_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0249_story_01_1015_013hib", "source_sha256": "abb140a4cc3194dd88b262a3075cff690061bb21137f764d5a2a1c6c88d29be2", "ja": "それで{$P$}、対戦相手は誰なの？\nやっぱり番組のレギュラー陣とか？", "zh": "那么，{$P$}，对手是谁？\n难道是节目里的常驻成员之类的？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0249_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0249_story_01_1016_p", "source_sha256": "ae9e4df102ff6ea0e86e0247cf86a3979535ecbcf677fa82f85ff333c58f68dd", "ja": "いや、レギュラー陣は審査員だな。戦うのは\nこの4人みたいだ。ふたりずつ、チームに分かれて。", "zh": "不，固定班底好像是评审。要对决的\n似乎是这4个人。两人一组，分成不同的队伍。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0249_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0249_story_01_1017_051tmg", "source_sha256": "285593224aee3a83124392f5dde5d994750416d54e1b9e59c19c4be2acf9ecc2", "ja": "ええっ！？　そんな……本来、チームワークを育むべき\nツアーメンバー同士で戦わされるのですか？", "zh": "诶！？怎么会……本来应该培养团队合作精神的巡演成员，居然要被迫互相战斗吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0249_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0249_story_01_1018_051tmg", "source_sha256": "449ae79491a33d8b26a5c1189b665cbd182f2db305057f3ce1701a8e42dd4991", "ja": "いささか趣味が悪いような……。\n見損ないました、{$P$}。", "zh": "未免有些恶趣味了吧……\n我看错你了，{$P$}。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0249_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0249_story_01_1019_p", "source_sha256": "67f78df20e26eddade42f08b8857f4235dd6cd62d4f2d626621f0bd3ffd0b1ea", "ja": "い、いや、別に趣味ってわけじゃなくて……\nそういう企画だから！", "zh": "不、不是因为我的兴趣……\n因为这是这样的企划嘛！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0249_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0249_story_01_1020_041fuk", "source_sha256": "d8ea8625882cd714c1b6a1dd8a7c67cc79e9cc1d27b7a0f40c5f0392f4e76d71", "ja": "つ、紬ちゃん、考え方次第じゃないかな？\n仲間同士で競い合って、切磋琢磨する……みたいな。", "zh": "小、小紬，我觉得还是看怎么想吧？\n像是同伴之间互相竞争、共同进步……之类的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0249_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0249_story_01_1021_013hib", "source_sha256": "07220214b04bf3dc7908448aeee6b132f81d05cfd66be45ca0f9b3d5301234e7", "ja": "そうそう！　むしろ自分、やる気が出てきたぞ。\n仲間だからこそ、手ごわいこともわかるし。", "zh": "对对！反而让我干劲十足了。正因为是伙伴，才更清楚对方有多难对付。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0249_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0249_story_01_1022_013hib", "source_sha256": "247f94eb77a93cfb79f39da4a71f99c706d7f78bb562e5e499b656c51305cf8d", "ja": "どんな勝負でも、誰が相手でも、自分は負けないぞ！\nみんな、本気で掛かってきてね。", "zh": "不管是什么比赛，不管对手是谁，我都不会输！\n大家可要认真地来挑战我哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0249_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0249_story_01_1023_023aka", "source_sha256": "532087e9fc6f4c009a6f1b84bc206b021726db051c8038b66c79258d28eda934", "ja": "ふっふっふ……望むところだよ、ひびきん！\n茜ちゃんも今回は負けらんない！", "zh": "呵呵呵……正合我意，响响！\n小茜这次也不能输！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0249_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0249_story_01_1024_023aka", "source_sha256": "c60f02e16b95807a6ab7c1754570f50fc4d7c9f8528cfd46a73fac21036b792d", "ja": "茜ちゃんが培ってきた、グッズ販売のノウハウ……\n全てを使って勝ちにいくよ！　ニャハーッ☆", "zh": "小茜积累下来的周边销售经验……\n我要把这些全都用上，争取赢下来！呀哈——☆", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0249_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0249_story_01_1025_041fuk", "source_sha256": "745dfcf12f930398929e3aeb0877e97bdb101317f6c12f727c0135b817b9faef", "ja": "でも、私達の勝ち負けならともかく、\nお店の勝ち負けですもんね。責任重大かも……？", "zh": "不过，如果只是我们之间的胜负还好，毕竟这可是店铺的胜负。责任可能很重大……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0249_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0249_story_01_1026_051tmg", "source_sha256": "f87a78d3e1c8a99a57d2b4bd0895017ec1089b0a9468775b188d5876eb6151cf", "ja": "うぅ……大丈夫でしょうか？　私は実家で\n店番をしていたくらいで、商売には疎いのですが。", "zh": "呜呜……真的没问题吗？我也只是在老家帮忙看过店，对做生意其实不太在行。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0249_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0249_story_01_1027_051tmg", "source_sha256": "0d2c66865bd3edd1a004b5862f6aa477b641ae82fda8dd2586655bcce1779ecb", "ja": "アンバサダーということは、戦略的に\nお店を盛り立てていかなければならないのでは……？", "zh": "既然是品牌大使，就必须从战略层面来带动店里的生意吧……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0249_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0249_story_01_1028_013hib", "source_sha256": "7c5a9f8090f184def3c30319c1e47c78432dea360a0948fe63884b607a2cb269", "ja": "紬は心配性だね！　きっと大丈夫だぞ！\n自分たちの勝負なら、ゼッタイに盛り上がるしね。", "zh": "纺，你太爱操心了！肯定没问题的！只要是我们之间的较量，绝对会热闹起来的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0249_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0249_story_01_1029_013hib", "source_sha256": "862c4b6e3f022d6519ac3d18b5477d3590d9711f78db7056eb58d7fbece13d0e", "ja": "それに、ひとりぼっちじゃないんだし。\nなんくるないさー！", "zh": "而且，又不是孤零零的一个人。\n总会有办法的啦——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
